    "title": "MICROSERVICE-development-billing-dotnet-api-Create Oidc Token-v1-spec",
    "description": "The OIDC Token Management API facilitates the generation of OpenID Connect (OIDC) tokens, which are crucial for secure authorization in a microservices architecture. This API allows applications to request tokens that grant access to various resources based on user authentication. Common consumers of this API include client applications that need to access backend services securely. Developers benefit by integrating seamless authentication into their workflows, enabling enhanced security and user experience.",
